&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1q:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4v4v1-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This role focuses on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1s:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4v4v1-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;driving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r1u:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4v4v1-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; business intelligence and performance optimization across regional marketing initiatives by leveraging existing enterprise data products and reports developed by our core internal team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r20:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4v4v1-4-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Rather than building new reporting infrastructure, this individual will serve as the expert user of established dashboards—analyzing results, diagnosing anomalies, and translating existing data into strategic insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r22:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4v4v1-6-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;This position partners closely with regional marketing leaders to review performance and conduct ad-hoc deep-dive analyses that support marketing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r24:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-1j6t0d7&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4v4v1-7-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;effectiveness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;popover-trigger-:r26:&quot; class=&quot;chakra-text css-bcri66&quot;&g